              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 20:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahonaaho ogwo mukazi yaagaruka aha bantu baamwo boona n'obwo bwengye bwe, baatemaho Sheeba mwene Bikuri omutwe, baagutambikira Yoabu. Yoabu yaateera enzamba, abantu boona baataataana, baaruga aha rurembo, buri muntu yaagaruka omu ka ye. Na Yoabu yaatabaaruka, yaaza Yerusaalemu ow'omugabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
