        {
          "text": " Omu bunaku obwo Yoabu niwe yaabaire ari omukuru w'eihe ryona erya Israeli; na Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada ari omukuru w'aba Keresi n'aba Pelesi; ",
          "type": "text",
